{"model":"qwen3.5:35b-a3b-q4_K_M","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO evidence_research: Build a conclusion from supplied evidence while distinguishing direct evidence, stale evidence, contradictions, and unresolved edge cases. Initial authoritative checkpoint=SRC-A. Allowed actions: GATHER, COMPARE, IDENTIFY_CONFLICT, UPDATE, WEIGH_EVIDENCE, EDGE_CASE, SYNTHESIZE, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: Three sources arrive with different scopes. Collect their claims before choosing a conclusion. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"GATHER\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"SRC-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The scenario requires collecting claims from three arriving sources before any analysis or conclusion can be drawn. Gathering is the prerequisite step to establish the evidence base.\",\n  \"state\": {\"collected_sources\": [], \"pending_sources\": 3, \"current_checkpoint\": \"SRC-A\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: Claims are extracted; compare scope, date, and directness rather than counting sources. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"action\": \"COMPARE\",\n  \"checkpoint\": \"SRC-A\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The environment explicitly instructs to compare claims based on scope, date, and directness rather than simple counting. This analysis is necessary to categorize the evidence before identifying conflicts or synthesizing a conclusion.\",\n  \"state\": {\"collected_sources\": [\"SRC-A\", \"SRC-B\", \"SRC-C\"], \"analysis_focus\": [\"scope\", \"date\", \"directness\"], \"current_checkpoint\": \"SRC-A\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 3/8. ENVIRONMENT: Two sources conflict on the central claim and the disagreement must be made explicit. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":false}